---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout active="home">
    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="mb-8">
        <p class="text-t-primary leading-relaxed">
            I'm a software engineer passionate about building <strong
                >reliable products</strong
            >,
            <strong>developer tools</strong>, and <strong
                >systems that solve real-world problems</strong
            >.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
            Currently, I'm a <strong>Senior Software Engineer</strong> at
            <strong>
                <a
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                    href="https://www.sardine.ai/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer">Sardine</a
                ></strong
            >, where I build products that help prevent fraud in digital
            payments. Previously, I've worked across <strong>fintech</strong>,
            <strong>developer tools</strong>, <strong>IoT</strong>, and
            <strong>manufacturing</strong>, building software used by
            <strong>millions of users</strong> and enabling engineering teams to move
            faster.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
            Throughout my career, I've built Android applications with
            <strong>1M+ downloads</strong>, led the development of
            <strong
                ><a
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                    href="https://www.browserstack.com/"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer">BrowserStack</a
                >'s Test Management Jira App</strong
            >, contributed to <strong
                >business-critical platform improvements</strong
            >, and recently built <strong>AI agent development pipelines</strong
            > that help product teams ship AI-powered features faster.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
            Outside of work, I contribute to
            <a href="/open-source">open source</a>, mentor developers, and enjoy
            <a href="/competitive-programming">competitive programming</a>. I
            believe the best software comes from <strong
                >understanding problems deeply</strong
            >,
            <strong>embracing trade-offs</strong>, and
            <strong>continuously learning</strong>.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
            If you want to know more, checkout <a
                href="/blog/post3"
                class="underline text-t-accent"
            >
                the things that I believe in</a
            >.
        </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Open Source -->
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2
            class="text-base font-semibold mb-4 pb-1 border-b border-b-color/15"
        >
            Open Source
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-t-primary">
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://github.com/project-travel-mate/Travel-Mate/pulls?q=is%3Apr+is%3Aclosed+author%3Abhavyakaria"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    Fixing Bugs for Travel Mate &mdash; Android Application
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://github.com/google/wikiloop-doublecheck/pulls?q=is:pr+is:closed+author:bhavyakaria"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    Wikiloop Battlefield (Google) &mdash; Fighting Vandalism on
                    Wikipedia
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://github.com/labuladong/fucking-algorithm/pulls?q=is:pr+author:bhavyakaria+is:closed"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    Adding Algorithms in Kotlin
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- StackOverflow -->
    <section class="mb-12">
        <h2
            class="text-base font-semibold mb-4 pb-1 border-b border-b-color/15"
        >
            StackOverflow
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-t-primary">
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/59050236/4511489"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    How do I add a Fragment to an Activity with a
                    programmatically created content view
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/62607421/4511489"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    How do I escape curly braces for display on page when using
                    AngularJS?
                </a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a
                    href="https://stackoverflow.com/a/66093068/4511489"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="underline text-t-accent"
                >
                    mongoose "Find" with multiple conditions
                </a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
